WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.840
Well, this is where you put into practice everything you had learned in class.

2
00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:10.540
It was like your internship, so we had to prepare, plan the meals for a week.

3
00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:14.880
You’ll find that’s in that cookbook, the menu for a week and some of these.

4
00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.180
Oh, here’s one: Cooking Within Your Income.

5
00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:19.800
This was after the Depression.

6
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.360
You see how they planned the menus.

7
00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:25.980
You’d have to plan the menu in the home management house for the week.

8
00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:29.580
Then you’d make out your shopping list for the week.

9
00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:33.180
You were not allowed to throw away a crust of bread for the week,

10
00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:40.240
so we had the strangest casseroles on Saturday because everything left over went in the casserole [laughs].

11
00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:49.560
And then you were graded on how well you prepared the food and how you served it and how you managed the money.

12
00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:54.180
At the end of the preparation you had to stay in the budget.

13
00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:56.560
And that was the foods.

14
00:00:56.560 --> 00:01:00.480
Then you also had to have skills in taking care of the appliances.
